body:
For people bumping into this, adding this component as a temporary fix prevents you from replacing all the `time` tags in your project.

``` ts
import { Component } from '@angular/core';

@Component({
    selector: 'time',
    template: '<ng-content></ng-content>'
})
export class TimeComponent {}
```

@SamVerschueren 

``` ts
import { Directive } from '@angular/core';
@Directive({ selector: 'time'})
export class TimeDirective {}
```
